The '''Ring of Love''' is an [[Accessory]] with 10 tiers that is obtained and upgraded via the [[Romero and Juliette]] quest.

== Effect ==
"Grants a 1 in X chance to deal {{red|+100%}} damage." The activation chance, X, scales from 1 trillion to 100, based on the item's tier. (see table below for details)

When the effect activates there will be a heart next to the damage value.

[[File:Heart.PNG|220x220px]]

